3467 0 obj
  << /ActualText (I joined SafetyCulture\047s Product Design team within the Analytics domain\054 where dashboards and reporting were core to how 75K\053 organisations understood their safety\054 quality\054 and compliance data\056 Leading end\055to\055end design through the double diamond process\054 I worked closely with product and engineering to modernise how customers create\054 visualise\054 and act on their data\054 from legacy chart\055building workflows through to AI\055assisted analytics\056 As SafetyCulture began investing in AI\054 I was moved into the company\047s earliest AI discovery and validation project\054 validating how and what insights should be surfaced across the platform\054 with the aim of AI proactively surfacing the right data to the right person at the right time\056)
     /K [ 28 ]
     /P 3468 0 R
     /Pg 3412 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
